From: maryny4 <147745036+maryny4@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 12:13:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] feat: add encoder backend selection option

Add encoder = "auto" | "software" | "vaapi" (config and CLI).
Auto keeps the historical try-VA-API-then-fallback behavior, software
never probes VA-API, vaapi makes encoder creation fail loudly instead
of silently falling back.

Gives users a supported way to pin the H.264 backend, e.g. to work
around the radeonsi VA-API white-screen (#21) without environment
tricks, or to guarantee hardware encoding is actually in use.
